    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woe to her that is filthy and polluted, to the oppressing city!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She obeyed not the voice; she received not correction; she trusted not in the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; she drew not near to her God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Her princes within her",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "roaring lions; her judges",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "evening wolves; they gnaw not the bones till the morrow.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Her prophets",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "light",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "treacherous persons: her priests have polluted the sanctuary, they have done violence to the law.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The just",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the midst thereof; he will not do iniquity: every morning doth he bring his judgment to light, he faileth not; but the unjust knoweth no shame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have cut off the nations: their towers are desolate; I made their streets waste, that none passeth by: their cities are destroyed, so that there is no man, that there is none inhabitant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I said, Surely thou wilt fear me, thou wilt receive instruction; so their dwelling should not be cut off, howsoever I punished them: but they rose early,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "corrupted all their doings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Therefore wait ye upon me, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", until the day that I rise up to the prey: for my determination",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to gather the nations, that I may assemble the kingdoms, to pour upon them mine indignation,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all my fierce anger: for all the earth shall be devoured with the fire of my jealousy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For then will I turn to the people a pure language, that they may all call upon the name of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", to serve him with one consent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From beyond the rivers of Ethiopia my suppliants,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the daughter of my dispersed, shall bring mine offering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In that day shalt thou not be ashamed for all thy doings, wherein thou hast transgressed against me: for then I will take away out of the midst of thee them that rejoice in thy pride, and thou shalt no more be haughty because of my holy mountain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will also leave in the midst of thee an afflicted and poor people, and they shall trust in the name of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The remnant of Israel shall not do iniquity, nor speak lies; neither shall a deceitful tongue be found in their mouth: for they shall feed and lie down, and none shall make",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "afraid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Sing, O daughter of Zion; shout, O Israel; be glad and rejoice with all the heart, O daughter of Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath taken away thy judgments, he hath cast out thine enemy: the king of Israel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEP.3.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEP.3.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the midst of thee: thou shalt not see evil any more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In that day it shall be said to Jerusalem, Fear thou not:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.16"
